    "reason": "[ev-2f328d4839ed] is a one-line changelog title. It says only that a CLI fix stops \"ignored resources\" from being pruned \"during restore\", and it points to PR #21894, which is not shown. It does not name the CLI command or flag that performs the restore. Neighbouring items mention `admin import` [ev-a5b549ff42a5] and `admin export/import` [ev-37207fd9c3f9], but the cited line does not link itself to either. It also does not define what makes a resource \"ignored\" (a label, an annotation or a setting), so neither the subject nor which environments are exposed (applicability) can be written as typed values. The PR or the docs for the restore/import command are needed.",
